# 1. Format and lint only staged files.
#    biome check --write applies all safe auto-fixes and re-stages the result.
#    If anything unfixable remains, the second biome check (read-only) exits
#    non-zero and the commit is blocked.
bunx lint-staged

# 2. Type-check the whole project.
#    TypeScript has no concept of "staged files" — cross-file type inference
#    requires the full source tree to be valid.
bun run typecheck
